## Per-language consumer cost, not a substrate comparison

Fixed Zig host; client language varies (Deno, Python, Rust, Racket binding,
Zig, plus Goblins as reference peer). Each row is a whole consumer stack, not a
language race. Fairness:
[bench README](https://codeberg.org/jimisaacs/pancake/src/branch/main/bench/langs/README.md).
Measure: `zig build bench-langs` (`-- --smoke` for a fast pass).

```=html
<!-- bench:langs GENERATED by `zig build bench-site-report`; edits are overwritten -->
