```

## Time-travel: snapshot and restore

Local vat snapshot/restore, off by default per actor. Cost scales with actor
count (shared state, not byte-copy of payloads). Charts show shape beside
Goblins; read the shape, not a runtime race. Measure:
`zig build bench-snapshot` and `racket bench/goblins/snapshot.rkt`.

